  "brief": {
    "en": "Early on a winding mountain pass, still engaged by the scenery. Fatigue is just starting to build from the curves (≈35) and drowsiness sits a little ahead on its own base rate (≈42) — low monotony, since a mountain road is never boring. The driver's classical/jazz taste and Joe Hisaishi oshi should already put his calm soundtrack piece on top.",
